<title>UK: Trocadero 96 pretax profit down 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Trocadero 96 pretax profit down 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996 (million</p>
<p>stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.16		   vs 0.58</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    1.23		   vs 1.83</p>
<p> Turnover		   10.68		  vs 8.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British leisure group is Trocadero Plc. 1996 was the company's first full year as an independent quoted group. Trocadero demerged from Burford Holdings Plc in 1995.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
